-- WoW Forever: Blizzard's live hotfix records of pushes 114199-114345 (every push after our newest import, 2026_11_18_50 _b, which
-- stops at 114196), plus 77 records of older pushes (113483-114093) that Blizzard published late and no file of ours holds. Records
-- from the public mirror of the live hotfix file (https://storage.googleapis.com/raidbots-static/wow/forever/enUS/DBCache.bin,
-- last modified 2026-11-23 20:22 UTC, build 1.60.1.71037), Blizzard's values unchanged.
-- Layouts: the cache is build 71037 and the server reads 70959 layouts. Every table written here has, in Blizzard's 71037 DB2 files
-- (CDN, build config 0acab1e6), the same layout hash as in DB2Metadata.h, and every record decodes byte-exact with our layouts.
-- What it brings:
--   Vampiric Embrace 15286 (16 Nov, push 114093): effect 0 heals the party for 10% (was 20), new effect 1 (1372611) +100% healing
--   on the priest, live tooltip; the server side is classic_spell_pri_vampiric_embrace / _heal.
--   Judgements as ranged attacks (11 Nov, push 113887): SpellCategories DefenseType 3 for every rank of Judgement of Righteousness,
--   Fury (with 1311650 / 1311655), Light, Wisdom, Justice and the Crusader (29 rows, among them 76253, 76317, 76330, 76334,
--   76345); Judgement of Command stays melee (13 Nov). Judgement 20271, Execute, Mutilate attribute changes (push 114313).
--   Maelstrom Weapon 408498 (10 Nov, push 113722): effect 1 base points 2 with the rank curve (TraitDefinitionEffectPoints 25235,
--   curve 128299: 6-10 procs a minute), effect 0 curve 85306 at -20 for every rank, aura options and tooltip.
--   Stormstrike 17364 (10 Nov): effect 2 100% weapon damage (was 150), 8 s cooldown. Wild Growth 408120 / 1238214 / 1238215
--   (13 Nov): healing coefficient 0.066 (was 0.033), interrupt flags. Blood Splatter 1329256 (effects 4000 / 6000, class options).
--   Push 114309 (Spell Piercing evidence): the Chastise ranks' tooltips and five removed SpellShapeshift rows.
--   World buffs and Darkmoon Faire fortunes (Nov 23): survive area changes; Sayge's fortunes and Fengus' Ferocity no longer double.
--   Holy Fire ranks, Healing Wave 11986, Revitalize, Intensity, Nature's Bounty, Mind Vision, Judgements of Light / Wisdom / Justice
--   durations, Battle Shout, the warrior / druid / shaman / mage / rogue / priest / warlock / hunter class option rows of push
--   114285 (40 changed, 9 removed, 2 hidden), cooking recipes (skill line ability 3962-60362), Goblin Mortar, spell interrupts and
--   target restrictions live removed.
--   Items (Item, ItemSparse, ItemSearchName, ItemEffect): 3663 Murloc Fin Soup, 4632-4638 lockboxes, 5525-5527 clam dishes,
--   5758-5760 lockboxes, 6786 Simple Dress, 9276 Pirate's Footlocker, 10053 Simple Black Dress, 11422 / 11423 Engineer's Renewal
--   Gifts, 12033 Thaurissan Family Jewels, 15699 Small Brown-wrapped Package, 15902 A Crazy Grab Bag, 16766 Undermine Clam Chowder,
--   16882-16885 junkboxes, 17962-17964 Sacks of Gems, 18972 Perfect Yeti Hide, 19296-19298 Darkmoon Prizes, 19425 Mysterious
--   Lockbox, 241233 [DNT] Super Strong Lockbox, 243177 Ingenious Toy, 252027 Gustberry Juice, 263439 Deadwood Tribal Beads,
--   274964 Mote of Unstable Magic, 279913 Ti'ik's Head, 291874 Ruined Herb Seeds; items live hides from its clients:
--   280952-280957, 280986-280996. Live's values win over 2026_11_21_95 for 11422 / 11423 (one flags field differs).
--   Quests 8318, 79365, 81924, player condition 169168, creature display 145586, object displays 135906-135908.
-- Left out: records whose newest live push is a shop push (above 16 million: items 212982, 219326, 219343, 273888, 273890,
